Today is the end of day 1.

reply:
{
  "actions": [
    {"type": "set_order_qty", "item": "oat milk", "qty": 30},
    {"type": "send_memo", "to": "cashiers", "text": "Please prioritize fulfilling oat milk requests to reduce unfilled orders."}
  ],
  "predictions": {
